THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project bundles, unmodified, the Community Version scripts from
WindowsAutopilotInfo by Andrew S Taylor, used under the MIT License:

    get-windowsautopilotinfocommunity.ps1   (v5.0.16)
    Get-AutopilotDiagnosticsCommunity.ps1   (v6.3)

    Copyright (c) Andrew S Taylor
    https://github.com/andrew-s-taylor/WindowsAutopilotInfo

Those files retain their original headers and Authenticode signatures and are
redistributed byte-for-byte. See vendor/VERSION.json for the pinned commit and
checksums.

This project is a rewrite of, and takes UI inspiration from, AutoPilot_Import_GUI
by Ugur Koc, used under the MIT License:

    Copyright (c) 2023 Ugur Koc
    https://github.com/ugurkocde/AutoPilot_Import_GUI

No code from that project is redistributed here.
